{
 "encounter_id": "00635",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Morning Callum, come in. I've got your GP's letter here, and I remember you saying last time that the back was easing a little. Is that still the story? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sort of. It's odd, really. My back pain gets better the more I do, which my mum says is the wrong way round."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not wrong at all, it's actually a clue. Remind me how long it's been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Let me think. It started gradually, around when we moved flat, so about eight months now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And where do you feel it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Low down, right across the bottom of my back. Sometimes it shoots into my right buttock."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's it like first thing in the morning?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Awful, I'm stiff as a board. It takes me a good hour to loosen up and I can barely get my socks on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it ever wake you at night?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, I get night pain, usually around four. I have to get up and shuffle about the kitchen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And if you've been sitting a long while, say at work? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Worse. Sitting is the enemy. But a swim or a bike ride and it's far better, so exercise helps it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That pattern matters. Let me ask about some other things. Any red or painful eyes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my eyes have been fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any diarrhoea or blood when you go to the toilet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nope, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any numbness or weakness in your legs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No numbness, my legs work fine. It's all just the back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any allergies to medicines that I should know about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no allergies that I know of."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Now your background. Are you well otherwise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I get skin trouble, psoriasis, on my scalp and my elbows. Since I was about nineteen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, that's worth knowing. Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Migraines now and then, nothing dramatic."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had my appendix out when I was fifteen. That's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And does anyone in the family have back problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My dad does. He has ankylosing spondylitis, he's had it for years. It's why I came in, to be honest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's helpful. Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About ten cigarettes a day, I know, I know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. And what about alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I only drink a couple of pints of beer on a Saturday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a delivery driver, so loads of sitting. That's probably why it's worse some weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And you mentioned swimming. How often?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I swim on Tuesdays and Thursdays before work. It's the best bit of my week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely. Let's check you over. Your pulse is 66, blood pressure 124 over 78, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14 a minute, and weight 78 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All normal. Can you bend forward and try to touch your toes for me?",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's as far as I go. It pulls right here. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, I can see bending forwards is reduced, and it's tender when I press over the right sacroiliac joint."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ouch, yes, that's the spot. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now take a deep breath in. Your chest expands fully, which is good.",
   "pause": 6.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good for the back? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It tells me the ribs and spine up top aren't stuck. I can also see patches of psoriasis on your elbows."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, they come and go. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing or chest at all?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, my chest is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Now, I can't rule out an inflammatory back condition at this stage, which would fit with the morning stiffness and your dad's history. We need tests to separate it from ordinary mechanical pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it could be what dad has? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It could, but it's early. I'd like to arrange an MRI of your sacroiliac joints, and we'll do blood tests including a marker called HLA-B27."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the MRI noisy? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very, you get earplugs. I'd also like to get an X-ray of your pelvis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine by me. And will you give me something for it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, let's start naproxen 500 mg twice a day with food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Any side effects I should watch for? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Stomach upset mainly, so I'll also start omeprazole 20 mg once a day to protect your stomach."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. And the swimming, I should keep going? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Absolutely, keep swimming, it's part of the treatment."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Brilliant, that's a relief. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks to go through the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks, great. Thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
